# Controlled Intensity

- One dominant intention per context. One primary action.
- `expressive` / `immersive` may rupture. `quiet` is mandatory for forms, auth, payment, privacy, destructive actions.
- AI is a capability, not an aesthetic. No sparkles, orbs, or chatbot-only nav.
- Consequential actions need a way back. No false urgency or fake live status.
- Provenance visibility matches risk. WCAG 2.2 AA. CWV budgets apply in every mode.
